Z||000006||William||01-28-2001||10:43 PM||||Well the Saga comes to a sad end. I have dropped the t-top project! I've just heard from FieroParts and the last trim caps are already on ebay, the glass panels are running low, and the Weather seals are not available and there is no way to piece together a replacement. This means I would have to cut my finshed car to pieces to install a leaking t-top, then install broken trim pieces in my restored interior. Doesn't sound to smart eh? I'm not sure if I would now even want a car with them preinstalled. What if you broke a panel or some other part? Pretty scary. Looks like a sun roof is the only reasonable option now. Mabye buy a spare sun roof glass and a couple seals before there gone to and hope for the best. I was so close.. :-( ||||reg||1
